  body (escaped "Double check we fully deliver https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-runners/issues/1, https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-runners/pull/2#issuecomment-7032593959 and also double check we properly handle use case of giving access to GPUs running on local system or on any other VPS with GPUs, so it is easy and cheap give access for GPU for GitHub.%0D
